    "summary": "Evaluate $\\left(625^{\\log_5 2015}\\right)^{\\frac14}$.",
    "summaryZh": "求 $\\left(625^{\\log_5 2015}\\right)^{\\frac14}$ 的值。",
    "answer": "D. $2015$.",
    "answerZh": "D。$2015$。",
    "methods": [
      {
        "title": "Match the exponential and logarithmic bases",
        "titleZh": "匹配幂与对数的底数",
        "steps": [
          "Put $L=\\log_5 2015$. Since $625=5^4$ and all bases are positive, $(625^L)^{1/4}=5^L$. By the definition of $L$, this is $2015$."
        ],
